<title>USA: AMB Financial stake cut by Jerome Davis.</title>
<headline>AMB Financial stake cut by Jerome Davis.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Jerome Davis and his wife Susan Davis said Friday they had reduced their stake in AMB Financial Corp to 59,000 shares, or 5.52 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, they said they sold 47,600 shares on April 2 at $14.125 a share.</p>
